// SIEM - Multiple Failed Logins - Windows
// MITRE: T1110 Brute Force
// Alert settings: scheduled, cron */5 * * * *, last 15 minutes, trigger when number of results > 0, action: Add to Triggered Alerts
index=windows sourcetype="WinEventLog:Security" EventCode=4625
| bucket _time span=5m
| stats count by _time, host
| where count >= 3
